<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [788].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>788&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;NATRONOARCHAEUM MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Casamino acids (BD-Difco)                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;4.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
